# Scratch probe files (keep out of structural scan / release verify)
# NOTE: the structural gate's per-file union (_untracked_scan_files) and
# full-scan mode (check_structural_scanners.py) ALSO exclude *_probe.py /
# _f1_* — .gitignore alone is NOT sufficient because the full-scan os.walk
# does not read .gitignore.  Keep these in sync with that exclusion.
_f1_*.py
*_probe.py

